  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social norms and practices transformed</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social norms and practices by community actors and faith organisations are shifted towards promoting young women&#x2019;s rights to dignity, bodily integrity and equal participation in decision- making.

Faith organisations policies, practices and teachings foster women clergy to participate in decision making and leadership within the institution.
	
Social norms that promote gender inequality and GBV (including SGBV) are challenged by faith and community actors.	

Men and young men women&#x2019;s rights champions within their communities promote gender equality and women rights.</narrative>
   </description>
